# Branches refused outright by githooks/pre-push, IN ADDITION to the driver's
# built-in `develop main master`. Appended, never replacing - this file cannot
# shorten the refused list, only extend it.
#
# `release` is the production branch: Cloudflare Pages builds madcowhq.com and
# madcowsailing.com from it, so a push here is a production deploy. It is
# entered one way only - a pull request from `develop` that the owner merges.
#
# The driver already refuses `develop` and `main` by their names, so they are
# deliberately absent below rather than repeated. Listing a branch twice is
# harmless but it invites someone to "tidy up" the duplicate and delete the
# wrong copy.
release
